 *
 * 16 kHz of 16-bit mono needs 32 KB/s, and the serial link underneath this
 * board's PPP connection only carries about 12.7 KB/s. Asking for more does
 * not fail loudly: the capture path simply drops whatever the transport
 * cannot absorb, which aliases the audio into something no recogniser can
 * read. 8 kHz mu-law is 8 KB/s, which fits with headroom, and it is the
 * quality the telephone network settled on for exactly this reason.
 */

